Star OS live environment - prototype M0.2

This is an unsigned test build of the Star OS shell prototype. It has no
Star OS installer yet. It is built from the Arch Linux live environment, so
Arch tools such as archinstall are present, but they are not the Star OS
installer.

The live user 'liveuser' has no password and can use sudo. Root is locked.
Session report: sudo journalctl -b -u staros-session-report -o cat

Do not use this image to install a system you depend on.
Report what you find: https://github.com/Jayyy-tuff/Star-OS/issues

